nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:15.020
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:20.240
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:20.240
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:26.240
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:26.240
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:31.580
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:31.580
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:36.130
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:36.130
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.340
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.340
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:42.890
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:50.450
Bonjour. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:02:03.790
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:01.220
And it sounds like they lost big to Team François!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.360
They lost big?

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:06.250
Team François had around the same number of sales

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:08.120
Team François France
Team Gomez Portugal

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.190
in the round one Food Wagon competition as Team Tennouji.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.480
They're one of the teams that's from the main Paris campus, right?

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:15.990
If I recall they made crêpes and sold more than 600.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.010
But to think that President Tennouji, of all people, would lose?

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:20.870
I can't believe it.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.720
Why'd they lose?

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.660
I can still remember how I suffered then...

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.710
I wanted to get my revenge in the finals... So, why?

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.370
Kashino...

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.050
Let's get the Chairman to tell us the details.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.890
There won't be any need for that!

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.470
Why not?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:43.840
Who do you think I am?

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.950
You should know well how amazing Miya is.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:52.750
recipe 48

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:52.750
It can't be, Henri-sensei<i>!</i>

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:58.450
Satou, Shiotani, please explain to them how Team Tennouji fell apart.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:00.870
As you wish, Ojou-sama.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:03.740
Now everyone, have a seat on the sofa!

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.560
But you sit next to me, Makoto-kun!

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.840
Why are they making it there?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.460
At Team François's request, they wanted everyone to witness it being made.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.690
Team Tennouji accepted, and it turned out like this.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.000
Stop!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.380
Will you show us the members of Team François once again?

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:47.220
The one on the left is the leader of Team François, François Adjani.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.880
The one on the right is Dominique Darrieux.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.120
Next are Katie Capucine, and Isabella Antonetti.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:59.970
I just saw them for a second at the welcome party and in the first round.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.860
But they're all incredibly beautiful!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.230
You think? I'm way prettier than that.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.810
Isn't that right, Makoto-kyun?

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.310
K-K-Kyun?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.240
I suppose so...

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.640
You make me so happy!

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.190
Uh...

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:20.740
We've only seen the introduction! Don't make Kashino pass out yet!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:24.720
You're really one noisy Spirit. What's wrong with loving him a little?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.250
Now here is Team Tennouji.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:35.630
Huh? Tennouji-san seems different than normal...

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:38.540
Different? That doesn't even describe it.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.450
Please take a look at this.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.340
What's with that amateurish tempering?

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:49.020
She's not concentrating on her work at all.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.650
Is this really President Tennouji?

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:53.590
She's like a completely different person...

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.810
This isn't the only part that's strange.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.560
My, oh my... That's quite poor.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.850
What happened?

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.190
It's like she's impatient or something.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.560
It really gets bad from here...

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.830
They even made a veil?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.530
That's a dress made from chocolate?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.420
It's too incredible for words!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.930
Compared to the dresses we made, it's on an entirely different level!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.010
So this is the ability of Team François?

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:56.340
Tennouji-san was so perfect, and yet...

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.840
How could something like this happen?

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:09.280
Team François
Team Tennouji

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.090
Enough already!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.310
I'm... going to see Tennouji-san!

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:53.970
Ichigo!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.470
Go see her? Where does she think she is headed?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.070
She's not back yet?

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.380
I see...

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.640
Acting before you think as usual, aren't we?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:13.660
Didn't we stay a night at a hotel in Mont Saint-Michel during our match in the semifinals?

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.360
That's right...

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.890
So Tennouji-san is still at Mont Saint-Michel.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.870
I can really understand why you'd be worried, Amano-san.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.430
But I think we should wait and try heading out tomorrow.

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.890
We're going back, Amano.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.470
It can't be helped.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:35.800
If you are that worried, then you can use my helicopter to go to Mont Saint-Michel.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.950
Koshiro-san!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.040
Thank you very much!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:47.350
We talked about it on the way here, but we really should be investigating Team François deeper.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:50.750
Team François are all students from the main Paris campus.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:56.900
We'll ask Lemon-chan on the other team representing the Paris campus, Team Ricardo.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:57.540
Okay.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.220
I wish Makoto-kun could have seen this with us.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:05.450
I'm sorry... All I ever do is ask you for favours...

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.600
Seriously!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.200
You're a real handful aren't you, Amano-san?

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.640
I'm sorry...

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.900
But well, I suppose that's one of the good things to like about you.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.180
Koshiro-san...

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.650
Honey-sama!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.190
Vanilla, Marron?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.150
You're Amano-san and... umm...

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:36.160
I can't believe you'd forget the name of the daughter of Château confectionery, Koshiro Miya!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.130
Uh, right...

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:43.350
We saw the DVD of the semifinals, and are worried about Tennouji-san.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.720
You came all the way from Paris?

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.270
In Château confectionery's helicopter it was a quick hop.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.340
How's Tennouji-san?

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.430
After we returned from the party at Mont Saint-Michel,

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:57.590
she locked herself in her room and won't see anyone.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.990
Tennouji-san...

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.650
Tennouji-san, it's Amano Ichigo!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:12.590
Tennouji-san, I want to talk with you!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.340
Please open the door!

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.540
Amano-san and Koshiro-san have come because they are worried about you!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.580
Please, I'm asking you, open the door!

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:26.140
Princess Mari!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:31.680
Tennouji-san...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.990
Move aside!

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.240
President Tennouji? It's Miya!

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:42.510
We came all this way worried about you, so what's the deal?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:50.640
In the semifinals of the main Cake Grand Prix in Japan you were quite lucky to beat the favourite to win, Team Koshiro!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:57.340
So since you ended up representing Japan, you have a duty to inform me of the reason why you lost today!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.750
So? Can you hear me?

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.290
If you won't let me in,

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:06.000
when we get back to Japan, I'm telling everyone of your cowardly performance!

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.470
T-That's going too far...

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:12.700
If I don't say this much then that Ojou-sama won't get it.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:21.850
Tennouji-san...

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.700
Come in.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.340
But...

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.230
Only Amano-san and Koshiro-san.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.090
Mari...

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.280
Princess Mari...

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:35.430
Please...

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:57.690
Sorry for calling you out this late at night.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:01.340
Don't worry, I made sure to get permission from the dorm supervisor.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:11.070
Team François is made of members Henri-sensei personally scouted from St. Marie Academy branches across Europe.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.940
They're the elite of the elite.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.780
Henri-sensei scouted them himself?

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:18.980
So they're all the same class as President Tennouji?

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:24.540
Their leader, François, is especially rumored to be the next great genius after Henri-sensei.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:31.310
As further proof of that, the sweet know as a Dijonaise au Chocolat,

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.670
has already been chosen as a Court recipe in the Kingdom of Sweets, supposedly.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.260
It what!?

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.120
She's still in high school!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.860
Well, I guess it's not a surprise that Team Tennouji lost then.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.830
This is bad...

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:47.420
We come this far, just to end up facing an opponent this overwhelming...

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.960
What're you so scared of?

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.700
We're gonna win it all and study in Paris, or have you forgotten?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.340
Kashino's right!

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:57.750
Didn't you all come this far to make your dreams into reality?

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:02.610
Yes... Dreams are things that disappear the moment you give up on them, after all.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:08.080
We've overcome everything that's happened up till now by working together.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:12.000
When we get back, we are going to start some special training for the finals!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.330
Yeah!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.480
Yamagishi, thank you.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:19.550
Good luck. I'll be rooting for you.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.170
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.050
Koshiro-san...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.750
You were the lofty goal that we looked up to!

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.090
All fault lies with me.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.000
Yesterday, at Montparnasse...

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.320
What nice weather...

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.500
Henri-sensei...

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.720
Who is that?

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:04.050
I didn't think you'd be practising even on a morning such as this.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.550
I apologise for bothering you on your morning walk.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.870
You really are just a practising machine, François.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:13.410
François?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:22.530
Mari from Team Tennouji is your opponent tomorrow. She's a very strong foe.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:25.300
I will lose to no one.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:28.070
Even to Team Tennouji's Mari.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.580
It looks like you are quite confident.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.830
I will win, without fail.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:39.670
Then I will participate in the new project you have recommended to me, sensei.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.880
New project?

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:49.060
I'm looking forward to it, François.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.480
Henri-sensei...

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:58.440
I will become a pâtissière, and I will always stay by your side.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:02.260
You are the best student I have ever taught.

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:06.110
There is still so much I wish to teach you.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:07.170
Yes!

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:11.050
And there is still so much I wish to be taught!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:16.240
No matter what I teach, you absorb it all almost magically!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.760
I can't help but to enjoy teaching others.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:34.870
Mari...

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:41.360
There is still time before we depart for Mont Saint-Michel.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.930
Get some rest.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:43.700
Yes.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.690
You are the best student I have ever taught.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:57.540
You lost your composure because of something like that? I've misjudged you!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.830
Koshiro-san, Tennouji-san really loves...

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.640
Miya is correct.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.470
Henri-sensei...

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.550
I've decided, Kashino!

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:13.550
What is it, Chocolat?

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:21.520
We'll head to the Kingdom of Sweets now, and go borrow the recipe for François's Dijonaise au Chocolat.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.790
That'd be a great help.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:28.090
To know our enemy, we first have to know more about their sweets, right?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.730
But where can you borrow it from?

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:33.780
It should be in the Court Pâtissier Museum!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.730
And you can borrow it just like that?

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:40.340
Since Ichigo-chan's grandmother's Spirit is the former Director,

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.440
we should be able to borrow it if we ask.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.280
I see. I'm counting on you.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.700
Okay, then we're off!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:49.310
The rest of you keep up the good work!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:16:00.850
I did not think you would fall so easily for the trap which I laid out for you.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:08.840
After I got a phone call from Mari asking about Team François,

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:12.780
I met with François and asked her to help me put on a little performance.

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:18.910
That was... all... an act?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.860
Why would you do such a thing?

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:30.540
Mari has relied on me too much ever since I taught her in Japan.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.930
When she couldn't decide on something she'd immediately consult me.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.480
She would worry and couldn't make decisions on her own.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.760
That's because Mari's heart is weak!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.600
She can't help it! Because she's in love with...

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.560
Those who aim to be pâtissières have no need for romance!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:55.570
Unless you truly put your entire body and spirit into making sweets, you will never make decent sweets!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.240
What are you talking about, sensei?

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:01.640
I'm always thinking about Makoto-kun when I'm making sweets.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:05.830
There is nothing wrong with making sweets for the one you love!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.540
So naïve...

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.090
I don't care how devoted you are to training excellent pâtissiers...

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.570
Playing with people's hearts is cruel!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:21.240
I believe that as the people eating your sweets start to smile, you must enjoy making those sweets even more!

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:23.300
Amano-san...

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:29.830
That by itself will never make you a pâtissière.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:36.520
Sometimes you must harden your heart, and drive back without hesitation any foe that stands in your way.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.080
It requires a strong heart.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.820
I don't want to go that far to make sweets!

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:48.880
I want to become a pâtissière like my grandma, whose sweets made people smile when they ate them!

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:53.070
You won't win against François thinking like that.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:59.420
How long will you continue to chase your grandmother's shadow?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.850
Madame Michiko is already a pâtissière of the past.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.100
