00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:57.300
But the crème brûlée on the inside counteracts it perfectly.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.630
So it has a spicy and mature flavour...

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:08.810
The base made by a pain d'epices au chocolat has cinnamon, pepper, and anise in it for spices.

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:12.690
I can see why this became a Court recipe.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.310
I hate to admit it, but this is delicious.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:19.520
